WEBVTT

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:30.916
from our color perception

00:03:30.956 --> 00:03:33.436
to our high visual detail,
to our central vision.

00:03:33.436 --> 00:03:36.676
All of this mediated by this tiny region.

00:03:37.956 --> 00:03:41.436
This is also the region
where your photoreceptors begin to die

00:03:41.436 --> 00:03:43.636
if you have AMD.

00:03:43.676 --> 00:03:47.196
In fact, a 1.5-millimeter
lesion in this area,

00:03:47.196 --> 00:03:50.556
which is approximately
the thickness of a credit card,

00:03:50.596 --> 00:03:52.436
will render you legally blind.

00:03:53.916 --> 00:03:58.156
